        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "skip my house twice while doing all the neighbors.\n\nFinally came, but then only clear halfway and left.\n\nThe previous driver who cleared the first snowstorm did a wonderful job. This one failed to maintain that expectation.\n\nCalled them when the driver was still on my street (I was on a business meeting).. yet driver wasn't notify in time and left only to came back an hour later and did half the job.\n\nCalled again, and was given an attitude of \"there are other clients that need clearing\".. as it was my fault.\n\nHope the rest of the season goes well...",
