        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "We switched to Como this winter and it has been the best decision! They have been absolutely spot on! Thank you and keep up the great work 💪🏻 Vaudreuil area",
        "time": 1768148968,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Aileen Frew",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107734147279931766337/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocL72BIiwjhT3R8GcUrEj98HtJlld_4KwJcdSzKhD9Wb7UZfBg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "I have read the other bad reviews, and have to disagree. In the 15 years we have been in our home this is the first year we used Como and the first time we have good, reliable snow removal!! We get an email in advance letting us know when we should move the cars, and when they will be coming by to clear the driveway. The guys do a great job clearing the driveway, almost right up to the steps! Finally, a snow removal company that we are thrilled with!!!",
        "time": 1739723537,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Chantal Giguère-Durand",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111624467941942548798/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIYHCxWteiHywvj8T3SZh44MjuqEfcy7-qVbaIv0qcuDGzgHg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "11 months ago",
        "text": "Great service from them this year! I was almost deterred by the bad reviews but decided to give them a shot given the poor service we had from the previous company. Turns out that they're always the first on our street - they do a fantastic job to clear the edges too so we can see out of our driveway, and often come 2-3x every snow storm to make sure they clear everything really well. Highly recommend them!",
